---
interface AppDownload {
  name: string;
  downloadUrl: string;
  qrImage: string;
  versionName: string;
  versionCode: number;
  size: string;
  abi: string;
  sha256: string;
  releaseStatus: string;
  releaseNote: string;
  privacyPath: string;
}

const { app } = Astro.props as { app: AppDownload };
---

<aside class="download-panel" aria-labelledby="download-title">
  <div class="download-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Android 安装包 / {app.releaseStatus}</p>
    <h2 id="download-title">扫码或直接下载</h2>
    <p class="download-warning">{app.releaseNote} 请先阅读隐私说明和安装提示，再决定是否安装。</p>
    <dl class="release-facts">
      <div><dt>版本</dt><dd>{app.versionName} ({app.versionCode})</dd></div>
      <div><dt>架构</dt><dd>{app.abi}</dd></div>
      <div><dt>大小</dt><dd>{app.size}</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="button" href={app.downloadUrl}>下载 APK</a>
      <a class="button-secondary" href={app.privacyPath}>阅读隐私说明</a>
    </div>
    <p class="install-note">
      Android 可能提示“未知来源应用”。仅在确认域名为 <strong>mdm.imspring.cn</strong>、包名和校验值一致时继续。
    </p>
  </div>
  <div class="qr-block">
    <img src={app.qrImage} width="240" height="240" alt={`下载${app.name} Android 安装包的二维码`} />
    <span>使用手机相机扫码</span>
  </div>
  <details class="checksum">
    <summary>核对 SHA-256</summary>
    <code>{app.sha256}</code>
  </details>
</aside>
